OL,3,AAnthropic warns of 'catastrophic risk'
OL,4,Ato humankind ahead of blockbuster share
OL,5,Alisting
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnthropic has not yet disclosed the
OL,8,Fnumber of shares to be released, their
OL,9,Fprice range, and a date for the
OL,10,Flisting.
OL,12,FThe Claude chatbot developer revealed
OL,13,Flosses in a filing on Monday of more
OL,14,Fthan $80.7bn (#60.5bn) in the first
OL,15,Fhalf of the year, but said it had
OL,16,F$112.4bn in cash or equivalents, and
OL,17,Fgenerated revenues of $16.3bn over the
OL,18,Fsame period.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
