OL,3,AUS Marine indicted for murder and
OL,4,Arobbery of woman in Japan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA US Marine has been indicted on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murdering and robbing a
OL,8,Fwoman in Japan earlier this month in a
OL,9,Fcase that has triggered protests,
OL,10,FJapanese media reports.
OL,12,FDevin Jacob Ballard, 20, who was
OL,13,Fstationed at US Marine Corps Air
OL,14,FStation Futenma, was arrested on
OL,15,Fsuspicion of killing Anna Yagi, 39, at
OL,16,Fa hotel in Naha, the capital of
OL,17,FOkinawa.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
