OL,3,AUS Marine indicted for murder and
OL,4,Arobbery of woman in Japan
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutors have now indicted him for
OL,7,Fallegedly strangling Yagi with a
OL,8,Ftelephone cord and then stealing her
OL,9,Fbackpack and wallet on 3 October, media
OL,10,Freports, citing the indictment
OL,11,Fdocument.
OL,13,FIt wasreported Ballard had denied the
OL,14,Fallegations, but Asahi Shimbun and
OL,15,FKyodo News cited investigators saying
OL,16,Fhe has made some statements suggesting
OL,17,Finvolvement.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
